# Testing Rules

- Framework: `xUnit` + `FluentAssertions`.
- Test naming format: `MethodName_Condition_ExpectedResult`.
- Follow Arrange-Act-Assert (AAA) structure.
- Unit tests live in `CalendarWidget.UnitTests` (test domain logic, calculators, ViewModels).
- Integration tests live in `CalendarWidget.IntegrationTests` (test EF Core, SQLite persistence).
- Do not write trivial tests that merely check framework assignment.
- All tests must pass before completing any task (`dotnet test`).
